	(text "TABEL ALAMAT I2C (GATE S4 — 7-bit, scan bus wajib tepat 3 device):\n  U3  INA219AIDCNR  0x40  A0=A1=GND (sheet 03_CURRENT_SHUNT)\n  U6  SHT31-DIS     0x44  ADDR(pin2)=AGND — default (Tabel 8 datasheet;\n                         0x45 bila ADDR=VDD — TIDAK dipakai)\n  U7  DS3231SN#     0x68  fixed (datasheet DS3231)\n  -> TIGA alamat UNIK — tidak ada tabrakan antar 7-bit address.\nJ_I2C_EXP: DILARANG device alamat 0x40 / 0x44 / 0x68 (termasuk modul\neksternal SHT31/DS3231/INA219 populer!) — konflik = bus hang.\nFirmware: I2C scan saat commissioning (TEST_PLAN §51) wajib 3-hit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 165 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7139b0ce-5eda-4139-b81a-492b25ba9ee4")	)
	(text "PULL-UP 4,7k (GATE: tepat SATU pasang utk seluruh bus — netlist proof:\nnet I2C_SDA memuat resistor R40.2 SAJA; I2C_SCL memuat R41.2 SAJA).\nNet I2C_SDA kini 6 node: U1.33 (GPIO21 master, sheet 02) + U3.6 (INA219,\nsheet 03) + U6.1 + U7.15 + J_I2C_EXP.3 + R40.2 — pull-up pada modul\neksternal (bila dipakai lewat J_I2C_EXP) TIDAK boleh dipasang.\nR40/R41 0603 1%: arus sink 3,3V/4,7k = 0,7 mA < 3 mA rating open-drain\nSHT3x/DS3231/INA219; rise-time ~0,4 us utk bus ~80 pF @400 kHz (OK).\nS9: R40/R41 ditempatkan DEKAT MASTER U1 (pin GPIO21/22) — kontrak\ntask spec 'satu titik, dekat master' (bukan dekat slave)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 170 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4519786d-ef9d-4373-b208-05e719f83f57")	)
	(text "U7 DS3231SN# (SOIC-16W, TCXO+kristal internal — tanpa komponen eksternal):\n  pin 5-12 N.C. 'Must be connected to ground' (datasheet) — koinisiden\n  pin 13 GND di simbol (auto ter-tie via DGND — pola koinisiden S2).\n  RST(4): pull-up internal 50k — datasheet LARANG pull-up eksternal; NC.\n  32KHZ(1) / INT-SQW(3): open-drain 'may be left open' — NC (pin map §2\n  tidak mengalokasikan GPIO utk keduanya).\n  VBAT(14): backup CR2032 via BT1 — power-fail switch otomatis (VPF ~1,9V).\n  C43 100nF C0G di VBAT = datasheet '0,1-1,0uF low-leakage' (DN-S4-05,\n  preseden DN-S3-04). JANGAN ganti X5R/X7R (leakage membebani CR2032).\nBT1 holder Renata SMTU2032-LF SMD (DN-S4-04 — finalisasi PRELIM §4;\nsaran contoh Linx BAT-HLD-001 tak tersedia di lib resmi KiCad).\nPENEMPATAN (kontrak §13): BT1 JAUH dari modul DC/DC M1 (suhu + medan H\n150 kHz) & dari RSH1 (panas 7,5 W @100 A); bukan di tepi board.\nUmur backup: ~1 uA (DS3231 power-fail) + CR2032 220 mAh >> 10 tahun."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 190 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d9add325-2abc-47e0-8fd7-c4bbd2657585")	)
	(text "U6 SHT31-DIS-B2.5KS — deviasi DN-S4-01: paket aktual DFN-8 2,5x2,5x0,9 mm\ndengan die pad (BUKAN 'LGA-8 3x3' per task spec §4 — datasheet Sensirion\nv7). Footprint resmi: Sensor_Humidity:Sensirion_DFN-8-1EP_2.5x2.5mm\n_P0.5mm_EP1.1x1.7mm (pad 0,55x0,25 pitch 0,5; EP 1,0x1,7 chamfer pin-1).\n  ADDR(2)=AGND -> 0x44 default; 'do not leave floating' (datasheet).\n  R(7): 'No electrical function; to be connected to VSS' — WAJIB ke\n  AGND (sering terlewat di modul murah!).\n  nRESET(6) & ALERT(3): floating bila tak dipakai (datasheet) — NC.\n  EP/die pad (pin 9, koinisiden pin 8 VSS): disolder ke PCB — rekomendasi\n  mekanis Sensirion (kekuatan sambungan + anti-warpage).\n  C40 100nF pin-adjacent VDD (datasheet §3.1).\nS9: U6 zona analog, >=20 mm dari M1 & dari antenna; cavity menghadap\nruang ukur (jauh aliran udara panas/korosif); 1 via EP ke plane AGND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 120 190 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "48cb4dad-5107-4fde-bb60-b03290b28462")	)
	(text "DOMAIN GROUND SHEET 06 (DN-S4-02): SHT31 + C40 -> AGND (kontrak task spec:\nsensor analog); U7 + C41/C42/C43 + BT1 + J_I2C_EXP -> DGND (peranti\ndigital — return I2C sejajar master ESP32). Bus I2C melintasi kedua\ndomain; equipotensial via NT1 (AGND-PGND, S3) + NT2 (DGND-PGND, S9).\nFW-SYNC (tambahan §8): (1) urutan init INA219(0x40) -> SHT31(0x44) ->\nDS3231(0x68); (2) polaritas arus INA219 (S3); (3) scan I2C 3-hit saat\ncommissioning (konflik = modul eksternal bawa pull-up/alamat nyasar).\nVBAT_RTC = net baru (DN-S4-03, class DEFAULT — tidak di-assign netclass;\narus ~1 uA). JANGAN tertukar dengan BAT+ 45-54 V (penamaan beda domaine!).\nTidak ada TP khusus VBAT_RTC — diukur langsung di pad BT1 (§41)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 215 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c6bc5d3-91dc-4609-bd85-78d64650e588")	)
	(text_box "06_I2C — bus I2C: pull-up 4,7k + SHT31 0x44 + DS3231 0x68 + BT1 + ekspansi (S4).\nR40/R41 4,7k 1% pull-up SDA/SCL ke +3V3 — SATU pasang utk seluruh bus, dekat\n  master U1 GPIO21/22 (S9); netlist proof: tepat 1 resistor per jalur bus.\nU6 SHT31-DIS-B2.5KS (DFN-8 2,5x2,5 + EP — DN-S4-01): VDD=+3V3 + C40 100nF\n  pin-adjacent; ADDR->AGND (0x44); R(7)->AGND (WAJIB datasheet); VSS+EP->AGND;\n  nRESET & ALERT -> NC (floating per datasheet). GATE: ADDR ter-tie.\nU7 DS3231SN# (SOIC-16W, 0x68): VCC=+3V3 + C41 100nF + C42 10uF; pin 5-12 N.C.\n  -> GND (datasheet; koinisiden pin 13); RST/32KHZ/INT -> NC; VBAT <- BT1\n  CR2032 + C43 100nF C0G (datasheet 0,1-1,0uF low-leakage — DN-S4-05).\nBT1 CR2032 SMD holder Renata SMTU2032-LF (DN-S4-04); jauh dari DC/DC (§13).\nJ_I2C_EXP (header 4-pin 2,54): 3V3/GND(DGND)/SDA/SCL — DILARANG alamat\n  0x40/0x44/0x68 pada device eksternal.\nGATE S4: alamat 0x40/0x44/0x68 unik; ADDR SHT31 ter-tie; pull-up tepat satu pasang."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 40)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b716dac7-c10c-4914-b0db-34049ce2d5af")
	)
